==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A somewhat easy stage that includes the mid [[Empire of Cats]] enemies, they aren't much of a problem to deal with if you have decent HP and attack units.

